---
const supportUrl = "https://buymeacoffee.com/vidjinnangnig";
---

<div class="support-card">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M4 9h13v5.5A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 12.5 19h-4A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 4 14.5V9Z" />
    <path d="M17 10.5h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 0 5H17" />
    <path d="M8 3.5c0 .9-1 .9-1 1.8M12 3.5c0 .9-1 .9-1 1.8" />
  </svg>
  <h2>Soutenir le projet</h2>
  <p>
    Orishatory est un projet bénévole et sans publicité. Un café offert aide à continuer à sourcer
    et documenter de nouvelles fiches.
  </p>
  <a class="support-cta" href={supportUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Faire un don</a>
</div>

<style>
  .support-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
  }

  .support-card svg {
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .support-card h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .support-card p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  .support-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-fg);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      opacity var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out),
      transform 100ms var(--ease-out);
  }

  .support-cta:hover {
    opacity: 0.92;
  }

  .support-cta:active {
    transform: scale(0.96);
    transition-duration: 100ms;
  }
</style>
